Material from the Commission on Audit

COA's Annual Audit Reports, and the passages this repository and the website
quote from them, are COA's work. Neither license above covers them. The
figures in data/ are taken from those reports; what this repository adds to
them (the tables, notes, corrections and checks) is under CC BY 4.0.

Section 176 of the Intellectual Property Code of the Philippines (Republic Act
No. 8293) says no copyright subsists in any work of the Government of the
Philippines, but that using such a work for profit needs the prior approval of
the government office that created it.
